1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,177
Owner ke liye sabse powerful section — Super Admin.

2
00:00:03,177 --> 00:00:05,482
Yaha se aap teen kaam kar sakte hain.

3
00:00:05,482 --> 00:00:09,967
Ek — naye users add karna, unko role dena, aur access control set karna.

4
00:00:09,967 --> 00:00:12,148
Admin, User-admin, Salesman, ya CA.

5
00:00:12,148 --> 00:00:13,830
Do — branches manage karna.

6
00:00:13,830 --> 00:00:16,945
Har branch ko include ya exclude karna reports se.

7
00:00:16,945 --> 00:00:19,561
Teen — license window aur billing details.

8
00:00:19,561 --> 00:00:22,988
Agar company grow kar rahi hai aur zyada users chaahiye

9
00:00:22,988 --> 00:00:25,417
yaha se upgrade request kar sakte hain.

10
00:00:25,417 --> 00:00:28,906
Ek zaroori tip — user delete mat kariye, disable kariye.

11
00:00:28,906 --> 00:00:32,519
Delete karne se unke past actions ka log gum ho sakta hai.

12
00:00:32,519 --> 00:00:35,448
Disable safe hai — audit trail bacha rehta hai.
